{'symbol': 'FOXA', 'date': '2023-02-08 08:00:00', 'title': 'FOX REPORTS SECOND QUARTER FISCAL 2023 REVENUES OF $4.61 BILLION', 'text': 'DECLARES $0.25 SEMI-ANNUAL DIVIDEND AND ANNOUNCES INCREMENTAL $3 BILLION STOCK REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION INCLUDING $1 BILLION ACCELERATED SHARE REPURCHASE TRANSACTION NEW YORK , FEB. 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FOX CORPORATION (NASDAQ: FOXA, FOX) ("FOX" OR THE "COMPANY") TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022. THE COMPANY REPORTED TOTAL QUARTERLY REVENUES OF $4.61 BILLION, A 4% INCREASE FROM THE $4.44 BILLION REPORTED IN THE PRIOR YEAR QUARTER.'}